From da1c34473367d6c007a53b0bf5eaefa5b7911d2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:19:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(widget): header ribbon (theme.ribbon)

A one-line message under the header, set by the host in theme.ribbon:
{ text, dismissable?, icon?, iconUrl?, background?, textColor?, id? }.
Fixed by default; a dismissable one remembers it was closed per agent in
this browser (same store as the feedback/consent flags). Colours are hex
only (anything else is ignored); with only a background the text is black
or white, whichever reads better; with neither it uses the accent colour.
Icons: gift, info, megaphone, sparkles, shield, or your own image via an
https iconUrl (non-https is ignored). Lazy-loaded to stay inside the entry
bundle budget.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ARKEhk1KiGHfWe6vuE6FJL
